notes.content:
Today we have an update with features that many of you asked for: Exit and Reset buttons. Everybody knows what is Exit button for, and for Reset it is pretty straightforward: after a confirmation you got all your level progress, amulets and upgrades wiped. It does not affect achievements except for 'Complete N levels' - those are not wiped but effect does not stack and if you had 49 of 50 levels completed with 3*, after reset you'll need to complete 50 levels to get the achievement, not just one. Same applies to weapon upgrades.

Other changes:
- level stat dialog got incorrect data for weapons left, fixed;
- on some machines there were few crashes, fixed;
- game frame rate is limited to 60fps fixing stall issues on 120Hz monitors;
- minor typo, sound and other fixes;

P.S. There are also iOS and Android versions of the game available for free.
Main difference is presence of in-game Market where you can buy more spells and amulets.
http://itunes.apple.com/app/id1006699098
http://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=net.runserver.siege_wars

